Start
- 3 tokens
Buy Phase
- 3 Cards, Choose which to buy
- 1 token to reroll
Placing Phase
- 3 by 3 grid
- Move cards from hand onto board
- Cannot see opponent placing because of divider till fight
Fighting Phase
- Attack in front if front row is blank attacks player health
- Healers heal  before fight starts ( 1 overheal allowed)

All dead bees go to the bottom of the shop deck on kill

Classes:
-Tanks do 1 less attack than attack bees
-Magic attacks 2 squares infront of them but upgraded can go three
-attack bees do most damage
-Healer bees heal 1 square in front of them, upgraded can heal 1 and 2 squares infront

